        "text": "03 · NUS Amgen Scholars Program"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Singapurdagi NUS Amgen dasturi. Kartochka avtomatik saralash natijasi sifatida e’lon qilinmagan."
      },
